{"id":20,"name":"raticate","speciesId":20,"dex":20,"form":"normal","generation":1,"types":["normal"],"stats":{"hp":55,"attack":81,"defense":60,"special-attack":50,"special-defense":70,"speed":97},"abilities":[{"name":"run-away","hidden":false},{"name":"guts","hidden":false},{"name":"hustle","hidden":true}],"height":7,"weight":185,"baseExp":145,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/20.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/20.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/20.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/20.ogg","genus":"Mouse Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"It uses its whis­ kers to maintain its balance. It apparently slows down if they are cut off."},{"version":"yellow","text":"Its hind feet are webbed. They act as flippers, so it can swim in rivers and hunt for prey."},{"version":"gold","text":"Gnaws on anything with its tough fangs. It can even topple concrete buildings by gnaw­ ing on them."},{"version":"silver","text":"Its whiskers help it to maintain balance. Its fangs never stop grow­ ing, so it gnaws to pare them down."},{"version":"crystal","text":"The webs on its hind legs enable it to cross rivers. It search­ es wide areas for food."},{"version":"ruby","text":"RATICATE’s sturdy fangs grow steadily. To keep them ground down, it gnaws on rocks and logs. It may even chew on the walls of houses."},{"version":"emerald","text":"A RATICATE’s sturdy fangs grow steadily. To keep them ground down, it gnaws on rocks and logs. It may even chew on the walls of houses."},{"version":"firered","text":"Its rear feet have three toes each. They are webbed, enabling it to swim across rivers."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"It uses its whiskers to maintain its balance. It apparently slows down if they are cut off."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It whittles its constantly growing fangs by gnawing on hard things. It can chew apart cinder walls."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"Gnaws on anything with its tough fangs. It can even topple concrete buildings by gnawing on them."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"Its whiskers help it to maintain balance. Its fangs never stop growing, so it gnaws to pare them down."},{"version":"black-2","text":"With its long fangs, this surprisingly violent Pokémon can gnaw away even thick concrete with ease."},{"version":"y","text":"The webs on its hind legs enable it to cross rivers. It searches wide areas for food."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Raticate’s sturdy fangs grow steadily. To keep them ground down, it gnaws on rocks and logs. It may even chew on the walls of houses."},{"version":"sun","text":"Its hind feet are webbed, so it’s a strong swimmer. It can cross rivers and sometimes even oceans."},{"version":"moon","text":"Its disposition is far more violent than its looks would suggest. Don’t let your hand get too close to its face, as it could bite your hand clean off."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"People say that it fled from its enemies by using its small webbed hind feet to swim from island to island in Alola."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its whiskers are essential for maintaining its balance. No matter how friendly you are, it will get angry and bite you if you touch its whiskers."}],"genderRate":4,"captureRate":127,"eggGroups":["ground"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"rattata","speciesId":19,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 20","Nível 20, À noite"],"species":"raticate","speciesId":20,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":20,"name":"raticate","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/20.png"},{"id":10092,"name":"raticate-alola","form":"alolan","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites